                                                "sense_id": "4dbcfa5f-0e61-3270-bee9-c6feb2442230",
                                                "text": "[I]n a final sentence he expressed his conviction that his opponents \"did not in truth represent the thought of the twentieth century, but might rather be regarded as mental fossils dug from some early Pliocene horizon \"."
                                            }
